## Command

```shell
biome lint --suppress file.mdx
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "markdown": {
    "analyzeEmbeds": true
  },
  "linter": {
    "rules": {
      "correctness": {
        "noUndeclaredVariables": "error",
        "noUnusedImports": "error"
      },
      "nursery": {
        "useTopLevelHeading": "error"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

## `file.mdx`

```mdx
{/* biome-ignore lint/nursery/useTopLevelHeading: ignored using `--suppress` */}
{props.title}

Some text

```

# Emitted Messages

```block
Checked 1 file in <TIME>. Fixed 1 file.
```
